{"duration": 20.81, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.84, "text": "For years, the sharks were here on\nalmost every day of the year, and people"}, {"start": 4.84, "end": 10.16, "text": "travelled to see them. South Africa\nprotected great whites by law in 1991, the"}, {"start": 10.16, "end": 16.0, "text": "first country to do so. After that, cage\ndiving grew fast. Along this southern"}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 20.81, "text": "coast, shark tourism came to draw\nmore than 80,000 visitors a year."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "text": "For"}, {"start": 0.14, "end": 0.6, "text": "years,"}, {"start": 0.82, "end": 0.86, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.86, "end": 1.08, "text": "sharks"}, {"start": 1.08, "end": 1.36, "text": "were"}, {"start": 1.36, "end": 1.62, "text": "here"}, {"start": 1.62, "end": 1.88, "text": "on"}, {"start": 1.88, "end": 2.26, "text": "almost"}, {"start": 2.26, "end": 2.98, "text": "every"}, {"start": 2.98, "end": 3.36, "text": "day"}, {"start": 3.36, "end": 3.6, "text": "of"}, {"start": 3.6, "end": 3.78, "text": "the"}, {"start": 3.78, "end": 4.1, "text": "year,"}, {"start": 4.3, "end": 4.58, "text": "and"}, {"start": 4.58, "end": 4.84, "text": "people"}, {"start": 4.84, "end": 5.18, "text": "travelled"}, {"start": 5.18, "end": 5.46, "text": "to"}, {"start": 5.46, "end": 5.62, "text": "see"}, {"start": 5.62, "end": 5.88, "text": "them."}, {"start": 6.36, "end": 6.48, "text": "South"}, {"start": 6.48, "end": 6.84, "text": "Africa"}, {"start": 6.84, "end": 7.32, "text": "protected"}, {"start": 7.32, "end": 7.66, "text": "great"}, {"start": 7.66, "end": 7.94, "text": "whites"}, {"start": 7.94, "end": 8.28, "text": "by"}, {"start": 8.28, "end": 8.56, "text": "law"}, {"start": 8.56, "end": 8.78, "text": "in"}, {"start": 8.78, "end": 9.46, "text": "1991,"}, {"start": 10.1, "end": 10.16, "text": "the"}, {"start": 10.16, "end": 10.42, "text": "first"}, {"start": 10.42, "end": 10.68, "text": "country"}, {"start": 10.68, "end": 10.98, "text": "to"}, {"s